      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T20:54:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed, fixed in PS2. We reviewed floor vs ceil vs round: ceil and round-to-nearest can exceed the advertised percentage on real fleets (e.g. ceil(25% of 201) \u003d 51, round(15% of 10) \u003d 2), which violates the RFE guarantee of at most N% of the fleet available for self-scheduling. Adopted max(1, floor(pct/100 * fleet)) when pct \u003e 0 and fleet \u003e 0: identical to floor for any fleet that yields at least one slot (your \u003e\u003d10-host fleets see no change; e.g. 60% of 10 \u003d 6), and a non-zero percentage never silently disables a small model (1 host @ 50% -\u003e 1). pct\u003d0 still disables. Test updated (first create succeeds, second rejected) and docs updated.",
